ARP/NDP Logging tracks and logs changes in the ARP (IPv4) and NDP (IPv6)
neighbor tables, capturing IPv4/IPv6 addresses, hostnames, MAC addresses
and interface changes. It is an arpwatch-style alternative for OPNsense,
configurable to selectively log new devices, MAC changes, IP changes,
hostname changes and interface changes.

WWW: https://github.com/mr-manuel/opnsense_arp-ndp-logging
